    <element xsi:type="archimate:BusinessService" name="Branch Portfolio" id="id-4b0306e589ba49fbba971157f1dd2077">
      <documentation>** 1. Role ** &#xD;
Evaluate coverage and relative performance of branches. Optimize product allocation and marketing activity across the available branch network. &#xD;
