    <element xsi:type="archimate:BusinessService" name="eTrading Workbench" id="id-5778733468de449fabc0252ec04ba660">
      <documentation>** 1. Role ** 
Operate the consumer e-trading facility (combines consumer device based application and network connectivity to the bank). This enables a customer to trade securities on their own account through the bank. A customer can initiate the execution of securities trades against their trading facility. The facility will determine and apply service/facility fees and charges as appropriate. 

 

** 2. Examples of use ** 

A consumer customer logs on to the E-branch web portal to access their e-trading account, tracks prices and research relating to his portfolio and executes and sale/purchase pair of transactions. 

 

** 3.Executive Summary ** 

This Service Domain supports consumer securities trading of their investment portfolio through the bank 

 

** 4. Key Features ** 

Investment portfolio management 

Securities valuation 

